Package: linuxfabrik-firewallfabrik
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends}
# The FirewallFabrik packages of mirror.plustech.de ship everything, including
# /usr/bin/fwf*, as one package named firewallfabrik.
Conflicts: firewallfabrik
Replaces: firewallfabrik
Description: firewall policy compiler for iptables and nftables
 FirewallFabrik manages iptables and nftables policies for many Linux
 firewalls from one central policy database with reusable objects, and
 compiles them into deployment-ready shell scripts. It reads Firewall Builder
 (fwbuilder) files and continues its approach with a modern code base.
 .
 This package contains the core and the command line compilers fwf-ipt and
 fwf-nft. The GUI is in linuxfabrik-firewallfabrik-gui.

